Design references

The base template's landing page (packages/cli/templates/base/packages/ui/src/blocks/)
takes its layout and visual language from Tailark (https://tailark.com), as seen on the
Tailark-built sites karigorai.com and bornoai.com. Tailark was a reference only: every
block is written from scratch, and no Tailark code, package or asset is included.

Third-party marks

The GitHub and X marks in packages/cli/templates/base/packages/ui/src/blocks/footer.tsx
come from Simple Icons (https://simpleicons.org), released under CC0 1.0. The marks
remain trademarks of their owners and are used only to link to the project's profiles.
